      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْفَاةٌ</span></b>  <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَاوُوقٌ</span>; (S, MA, K, TA;) i. e. <i>A
strainer;</i> (MA; [thus accord. to modern usage;])
<i>a clarifier;</i> i. e. <i>a thing from which clearing,</i> or
<i>clarifying, is effected;</i> called by the vulgar <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مصفيَّة</span>
[i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْفَيَّة</span>, and also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِصْفَايَة</span>]: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَصَافٍ</span>. (TA.)

